owner of mod/x.txt; the test fails with the round 3 validate_scope.go overlaid.\"},\n{\"id\":\"R3-N2\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"scopeRootPrefix trims only the newline and returns the error; the leading-space test passes and fails with the round 3 file overlaid; a stand-in probe shows the selection failing with Git message. Test gap is N2.\"},\n{\"id\":\"R3-N3\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"Probe with root a/b: a/c/f.txt is named ../c/f.txt and the declared dependency ../c selects the module; a top file is ../../z.txt.\"},\n{\"id\":\"R3-N4\",\"status\":\"not-fixed\",\"evidence\":\"Probe still returns changed empty for an untracked outside file; recorded as a spec follow-up; reported as N5.\"},\n{\"id\":\"R3-N5\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"evidence\":\"The function and test comments are fixed in db5b95bf..0cad568a; git grep still finds One line, bounded at report.go:313 (N1).\"}\n],\n\"sweep\":\"The round 4 delta line by line and the nine code files of the range as they bear on R1-R5: ready transitions, report note and warning, scope diff, prefix, naming and untracked listing, carry consumers, the amended spec; focused tests and go vet, a round 3 overlay, probes over lower, nested, spaced and non-ASCII roots, diff.relative, prefix failure and odd spec names, and every planned pose tool including both validate runs.\",\n\"criteria\":[\n{\"id\":\"assumption-integrity\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Verified by probe that the diff output form is now pinned and the prefix is taken whole. Carry staying off below the top is read, not run. Untracked outside files and carry naming are open risks N5 and N6; L1 was read and is not disputed.\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-concurrency\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"The delta adds no shared state; the concurrent index-read test is in the focused run, which passed.\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-contracts\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/delivery-integration\",\"rationale\":\"No schema or tool contract change; at the repository top names are unchanged.\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-input-errors\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Failed prefix and untracked reads fail the selection with a bounded cause; revisions stay validated.\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-integration-impact\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/check-git-spawns-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Selection consumers receive root-relative names; the sealed spawn contract passes.\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-observability\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"The warning and selection errors carry Git message; the report test requires it.\"},\n{\"id\":\"compatibility\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Probe at the top, with and without diff.relative, gives the same names and selection as before; lower-root answers change only toward the stated behaviour.\"},\n{\"id\":\"correctness\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Focused tests pass and the lower-root probes select as expected; the remaining gaps are low and pre-existing.\"},\n{\"id\":\"design-causality\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Pinning diff.relative fixes the input form the naming depends on, which was the cause of R3-N1; relative paths address R3-N3; D1 removes the redaction cause. The design assessment observed no structural deltas.\"},\n{\"id\":\"documentation\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/distributed-instructions-parity-integration\",\"rationale\":\"The spec API section and execution log match the probed behaviour; leftover comment and trace text are N1 and N3.\"},\n{\"id\":\"operability\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Errors name the range, the command and what Git said; the report says where the cause was printed.\"},\n{\"id\":\"requirements\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"R1 to R5 as amended each have a passing focused test; L1 covers the ledger deadline.\"},\n{\"id\":\"scope\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"The nine code files match the spec artifact list; the scope naming answers earlier findings and is stated in the API section.\"},\n{\"id\":\"security\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Outside names are only matched as strings in the code read; the versioned report interpolates nothing from Git.\"},\n{\"id\":\"solution-proportionality\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"One config pin, a prefix lookup and filepath.Rel are the smallest change that keeps outside files; it would not suffice if untracked outside files had to count, N5.\"}\n],\n\"tools\":[\n{\"id\":\"artifact-check\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose artifact-check --spec pose-validate-index-reads-residuals --strict\",\"rationale\":\"Exit 0.\"},\n{\"id\":\"assess-design\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"structure:design-9650dd4bb1879cd0\",\"rationale\":\"Observed, no deltas.\"},\n{\"id\":\"assess-discover\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose assess discover --no-persist --component pose-mcp\"},\n{\"id\":\"assess-integrate\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/engine-reads-raw-history-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Ran with --no-persist.\"},\n{\"id\":\"assess-tech-debt\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose assess tech-debt --no-persist\",\"rationale\":\"The scan reports itself incomplete: two spec sources could not be read.\"},\n{\"id\":\"closeout-check\",\"disposition\":\"deferred\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose closeout-check spec:pose-validate-index-reads-residuals\",\"rationale\":\"Ran; cannot pass before the review is recorded and the spec is done.\"},\n{\"id\":\"review-check\",\"disposition\":\"deferred\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose review-check spec:pose-validate-index-reads-residuals\",\"rationale\":\"Ran; no fresh review record exists.\"},\n{\"id\":\"suggest-review\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose suggest review --path pose-mcp\"},\n{\"id\":\"surface-check\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/delivery-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Ran with --strict: zero findings.\"},\n{\"id\":\"validate\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Rests on the sealed result. The sandbox rerun FAILED: 236 steps, 224 pass, 11 fail, 1 timeout, the same failing steps as earlier rounds. Causes seen in round 1 include HTTP 403 and ownership refusals of /var/tmp and /home; others were not root-caused. No failing test name is one this change adds or edits.\"},\n{\"id\":\"validate\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Rests on the sealed result. The sandbox rerun FAILED: 233 steps, 221 pass, 11 fail, 1 error, with the same failing test names as the root run.\"}\n]}\n```","ttft_ms":2339,"type":"result","duration_ms":58937,"uuid":"77130931-138c-4700-86ab-2629b50d4594","ttft_stream_ms":924,"time_to_request_ms":36,"first_content_frame_ms":924,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":2,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":10275,"cacheReadInputTokens":1382892,"cacheCreationInputTokens":7415,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2707232,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":403,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":7415,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5"